WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:01.160
- Yep--
- Oh my god!

00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:02.236
(Brooklynn screams)
- Oh my gosh!

00:00:02.236 --> 00:00:03.420
Oh my gosh!

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:05.951
Oh my gosh, I can't do
that; no, no, no, thank you.

00:00:05.951 --> 00:00:08.670
(upbeat music)

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:09.890
- Hi everyone, my name is Devin,

00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:11.840
and today we're playing What's in the Box:

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:12.800
The Horror Edition

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:14.370
with the cast of "The Turning."

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:16.510
So if you've ever wondered what it's like

00:00:16.510 --> 00:00:18.870
to be a nanny working in a haunted house,

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:20.270
you should check out "The Turning."

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:21.103
(screams)

00:00:21.103 --> 00:00:21.936
(dramatic music)

00:00:21.936 --> 00:00:24.110
(panting)

00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:24.943
- Bad dreams?

00:00:24.943 --> 00:00:27.181
- "The Turning" was so scary-

00:00:27.181 --> 00:00:28.232
(soft haunting music)

00:00:28.232 --> 00:00:30.490
(loud gasp)
(scream)

00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:32.270
Make sure that you empty your bladder

00:00:32.270 --> 00:00:33.530
before you see this bad boy.

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:34.790
- I play Flora.

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:37.010
There's a lot of mystery to her.

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:38.740
- [Kate Character] What
happened to your last nanny?

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:40.110
- Like I'd tell.

00:00:40.110 --> 00:00:42.352
- I play Miles. He's
kind of a dick (laughs).

00:00:42.352 --> 00:00:43.472
(laughter)

00:00:43.472 --> 00:00:44.470
(dramatic music)

00:00:44.470 --> 00:00:45.830
I know what you're afraid of.

00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:47.900
He's just like constantly
has a wrestling match

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:48.733
going on in his head.

00:00:48.733 --> 00:00:50.501
You shouldn't be in here.

00:00:50.501 --> 00:00:51.730
(loud startling gasp)
(glass shatters loudly)

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:53.240
- I play Kate.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:55.980
This is my first live-in job.

00:00:55.980 --> 00:00:57.040
And I come into the house

00:00:57.040 --> 00:00:58.240
that these kids live in.

00:01:00.130 --> 00:01:01.033
Hello.

00:01:02.301 --> 00:01:03.900
(dramatic music)
(screams)

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:06.370
- You're lucky we didn't
put a snake in your boots.

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:07.992
- You're lucky I don't
put a snake in your boots.

00:01:07.992 --> 00:01:10.575
(upbeat music)

00:01:12.390 --> 00:01:13.930
- This is our mystery box.

00:01:13.930 --> 00:01:15.410
And you're gonna slide your hand

00:01:15.410 --> 00:01:16.820
right down all the way in there,

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:19.210
and whoever can guess what's in the box

00:01:19.210 --> 00:01:20.730
and what they're feeling wins.

00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:22.990
- I'm like, teeth-chattering nervous.

00:01:22.990 --> 00:01:24.329
But--

00:01:24.329 --> 00:01:25.648
(faint air blowing)

00:01:25.648 --> 00:01:27.920
(soft music)

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:29.472
- [Devin] So this is our first time.

00:01:29.472 --> 00:01:30.392
- [Finn] Okay.

00:01:30.392 --> 00:01:31.350
- [Mackenzie] Oh my god.

00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:32.832
- [Devin] Finn do you wanna try it?

00:01:32.832 --> 00:01:34.740
(screams)

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:36.730
- [Mackenzie] I'll do it.
I'll do it with you, come on.

00:01:36.730 --> 00:01:37.563
- Oh.

00:01:38.438 --> 00:01:39.271
(laughing)

00:01:39.271 --> 00:01:40.104
Straight up, a bug.

00:01:40.104 --> 00:01:42.280
- Let's reveal what's in the box.

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:43.383
- [Finn] It's like--

00:01:43.383 --> 00:01:44.392
(shouting)

00:01:44.392 --> 00:01:45.225
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:45.225 --> 00:01:46.720
Oh my gosh, what's that big thing?

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:49.090
- [Devin] Do you know
this is actually a baby?

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:49.960
It's a baby cockroach.

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:52.880
- Oh my god, that's an
insane thing to put in there.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:55.297
(soft music)

00:01:57.490 --> 00:01:58.770
- [Devin] All right,
let's turn around and see

00:01:58.770 --> 00:02:00.190
what's in this box.

00:02:00.190 --> 00:02:02.990
- I feel like this is such an act of faith

00:02:02.990 --> 00:02:05.310
after what you just did.
- I'm the littlest.

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:06.450
- [Mackenzie] What did you do?

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:07.800
Oh I am so scared.

00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:08.633
I am so sorry--

00:02:08.633 --> 00:02:09.849
- All right, Finn show 'em how it's done.

00:02:09.849 --> 00:02:10.783
- I'm still rattled by
the cockroach thing.

00:02:14.249 --> 00:02:15.082
(laughing)

00:02:15.082 --> 00:02:15.915
- All right, guys.

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:18.123
Oh my gosh.

00:02:18.980 --> 00:02:21.147
(screams)

00:02:23.528 --> 00:02:24.600
(laughing)

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:25.433
- [Finn] It's a person.

00:02:25.433 --> 00:02:27.340
- [Brooklynn] Oh my gosh.

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:29.300
- This is such a good game.

00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:31.160
(laughing)

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:34.410
- I've never seen you like this before.

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:37.140
(upbeat music)

00:02:37.140 --> 00:02:38.450
- [Devin] Let's see, what's in this box?

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:39.660
Who wants to put their hand in first?

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:40.500
- You do it.

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:41.637
- You do it.

00:02:41.637 --> 00:02:43.760
- One safe space.

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:44.760
- [Finn] Then do it.

00:02:46.712 --> 00:02:47.643
- [Mackenzie] What's in it?

00:02:47.643 --> 00:02:49.700
- It's very cold.

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:50.720
- [Mackenzie] Describe to the audience.

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:53.000
- [Finn] Is it like chicken
or some chicken breast.

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:53.833
(laughing)

00:02:53.833 --> 00:02:54.830
- Follow-up question: Do you think you

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:56.170
put this in your mouth?

00:02:56.170 --> 00:02:57.500
- Ick, don't ever.

00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:59.760
It's probably...

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:00.839
Oh, it's fish.

00:03:00.839 --> 00:03:01.780
- It's fish.

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:03.712
Let's see what's in this box.

00:03:03.712 --> 00:03:04.751
- Oh.

00:03:04.751 --> 00:03:05.790
Aw, that's gross.

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:06.851
- It's dinner.

00:03:06.851 --> 00:03:07.684
- [Finn] Hi, buddy.

00:03:07.684 --> 00:03:09.480
(dramatic music)

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:10.531
- Miles.

00:03:10.531 --> 00:03:11.364
- Nothing should have to suffer.

00:03:11.364 --> 00:03:12.560
- So thank you, guys, so much for playing

00:03:12.560 --> 00:03:14.221
What's in the Mystery Box.
- Thank you.

00:03:14.221 --> 00:03:15.133
- Thank you for having us.
- You are so brave.

00:03:15.133 --> 00:03:16.190
Finn, you are the winner.

00:03:16.190 --> 00:03:17.350
So you can tell everyone you know.

00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:18.800
- Finn was the most brave.

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:19.690
- [Devin] Make sure you see "The Turning"

00:03:19.690 --> 00:03:20.970
in theaters January 24.

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:22.550
- [Brooklynn] Woo hoo!

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:23.750
- Sorry if I scared you.

00:03:24.768 --> 00:03:26.935
(screams)

